180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nComparison in https://github.com/Calinou/godot-reflection in 1920×1080, using `-- --benchmark` command line argument and specific frames from a Movie Maker mode recording (at 60 FPS):\r\n\r\n### During normal rotation\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n![Screenshot_20251118_003636](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fdf81875-0281-4109-a6f2-08a6972946fa) | ![Screenshot_20251118_003631](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8c7d2f94-415f-4ea7-8b25-4da05fd2b2dd)\r\n\r\n### During fast rotation\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n![Screenshot_20251118_003453](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8df4d8ae-8c6f-443c-aea0-e748c0ad6edf) | ![Screenshot_20251118_003445](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/94d5f153-b3bc-477f-8c29-6d97a7fc5321)\r\n\r\n### During very fast rotation\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n![Screenshot_20251118_003653](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b4f1adc5-7f7b-4e96-ba92-e79df88b2561) | ![Screenshot_20251118_003650](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/37e40968-d9c9-489d-9af9-edb49d2dbb58)\r\n\r\nThe benefit is mostly visible in fast (but not too fast) rotations. Antialiasing coverage is improved, without increasing blur too much.\r\n\r\nThis PR also seems to do a good job at 720p and 4K from my testing. Example in 720p at 60 FPS:\r\n\r\n### Before\r\n\r\n*Notice the trail in the top-right corner at the beginning of the video, behind the ladder.*\r\n\r\n[before.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/54a94ede-7688-41ab-afd8-20e623722785)\r\n\r\n### After\r\n\r\n*The trail is much shorter now.*\r\n\r\n[after.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d52cc6bd-705b-4374-b89c-032beb14b25a)\r\n","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112196#pullrequestreview-3475047901","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112196","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112196#pullrequestreview-3475047901"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112196"}},"submitted_at":"2025-11-18T00:29:26Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3475622355,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7PKcnT","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://